    given-names: Aditya
repository-code: https://github.com/adityavsb/rag-eval-harness
license: MIT
version: 0.3.0
date-released: 2026-11-20
abstract: >-
  Evaluation harness for engineering-runbook retrieval-augmented generation on an
  authored corpus. Compares chunking, BM25 + dense RRF hybrid search, cross-encoder
  reranking, DSPy prompt compilation, and LangGraph Corrective RAG with bootstrap
  confidence intervals, McNemar tests, and live OpenRouter generation judged by
  Perplexity Decider. Aggregate results are versioned in git; per-query traces remain local.
